  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/09/IMG_9766.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El caf&eacute; rock La Oveja Negra de Onda ha celebrado la noche de este s&aacute;bado la fiesta de su segundo aniversario, que culmina todo un mes de actos culturales. Amistades y clientela han podido participar de concursos y ganar premios explotando los globos que hab&iacute;a sobre la barra.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/2onaniversarilaovejanegra.jpg\" alt=\"2onaniversarilaovejanegra\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9759.jpg\" alt=\"img_9759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9763.jpg\" alt=\"img_9763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9764.jpg\" alt=\"img_9764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9765.jpg\" alt=\"img_9765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9766.jpg\" alt=\"img_9766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9768.jpg\" alt=\"img_9768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/img_9769.jpg\" alt=\"img_9769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onaniversarilaovejanegraonda/im